{% comment %}
  Homepage Instagram row — the Custom Liquid section under "FOLLOW US ON INSTAGRAM".

  Deliberately empty of content. The hero, the profile header, the post grid and
  the popup are all built by the widget Carbon serves at /instagram/widget, and
  every value it uses — hero image, overlay text, handle, follow button — is
  edited at app.shopcarbon.com/studio/instagram-widget. Nothing about the
  section lives in the theme any more, so changing it never means touching
  Shopify, and the live row cannot drift from what the studio shows.

  Posts come from Carbon's own endpoint, which calls Meta at most once every 15
  minutes and serves every shopper from cache — traffic can never exhaust a
  quota, which is what took the previous third-party widget offline. The access
  token stays on the server and never reaches the browser.

  If the feed is ever unavailable the widget renders nothing at all, leaving
  this container empty rather than showing a broken or half-filled section.
{% endcomment %}

<div data-carbon-instagram></div>
<script src="https://app.shopcarbon.com/instagram/widget" defer></script>
